MaybeName is typeInstance
MaybeName purpose "A name that may be absent"
MaybeName instantiates option.Option String

Numbers is typeInstance
Numbers purpose "A growable list of whole numbers"
Numbers instantiates list.List Int64

Size is record
Size purpose "A width and a height"
Size typeParameter none
Size field width Int64
Size field height Int64

Inner is enum
Inner purpose "A label or nothing, nested inside another enum"
Inner typeParameter none
Inner variant label String
Inner variant blank none

Shape is enum
Shape purpose "A shape that carries a record, a list, or another enum"
Shape typeParameter none
Shape variant box Size
Shape variant points Numbers
Shape variant tagged Inner
Shape variant empty none

InputError is enum
InputError purpose "Why input was rejected, with a message for the person who gave it"
InputError typeParameter none
InputError variant rejected String

Labelled is record
Labelled purpose "A list of numbers with the shape it came from, compared field by field"
Labelled typeParameter none
Labelled field numbers Numbers
Labelled field shape Shape

check is operation
check purpose "Reject every input with a message"
check invariant none
check typeParameter none
check input text String borrowed
check output Int64
check outputOwnedBy none
check raises InputError
check effect none
check uses none
check memoryHeap false
check async false
check maxRecursion none
check label begin loopKind none
check label begin within none
check let message String "bad input" immutable
check at begin do makeError
check at begin return error failure

makeError is call
makeError in check
makeError invokes InputError.rejected
makeError argument payload String message give
makeError result failure InputError
makeError ownedBy none
makeError cleanedBy none
makeError borrows none
makeError catch none
makeError suppresses none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label readName loopKind none
main label readName within none
main label showName loopKind none
main label showName within none
main label readAbsent loopKind none
main label readAbsent within none
main label showNobody loopKind none
main label showNobody within none
main label readBox loopKind none
main label readBox within none
main label showBox loopKind none
main label showBox within none
main label readPoints loopKind none
main label readPoints within none
main label showPoints loopKind none
main label showPoints within none
main label inspectError loopKind none
main label inspectError within none
main label showWhy loopKind none
main label showWhy within none
main label readTagged loopKind none
main label readTagged within none
main label readInner loopKind none
main label readInner within none
main label showLabel loopKind none
main label showLabel within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let ada String "Ada" immutable
main let nobodyText String "nobody" immutable
main let innerText String "inner" immutable
main let otherText String "other" immutable
main let input String "x" immutable
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let two Int64 2 immutable
main let three Int64 3 immutable
main let four Int64 4 immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let failCode ExitCode 1 immutable
main at begin do makePresent
main at begin goto readName
main at readName match present MaybeName
main at readName case MaybeName.present bind name String goto showName
main at readName case MaybeName.absent bind none none goto failed
main at showName do printName
main at showName do makeAbsent
main at showName goto readAbsent
main at readAbsent match absent MaybeName
main at readAbsent case MaybeName.present bind other String goto failed
main at readAbsent case MaybeName.absent bind none none goto showNobody
main at showNobody do printNobody
main at showNobody do makeSize
main at showNobody do makeBox
main at showNobody goto readBox
main at readBox match box Shape
main at readBox case Shape.box bind size Size goto showBox
main at readBox case Shape.points bind boxPoints Numbers goto failed
main at readBox case Shape.tagged bind boxInner Inner goto failed
main at readBox case Shape.empty bind none none goto failed
main at showBox do readWidth
main at showBox do printWidth
main at showBox do makeNumbers
main at showBox do appendOne
main at showBox do appendTwo
main at showBox do appendThree
main at showBox do appendFour
main at showBox do makePoints
main at showBox goto readPoints
main at readPoints match points Shape
main at readPoints case Shape.box bind pointsSize Size goto failed
main at readPoints case Shape.points bind list Numbers goto showPoints
main at readPoints case Shape.tagged bind pointsInner Inner goto failed
main at readPoints case Shape.empty bind none none goto failed
main at showPoints do countPoints
main at showPoints do printCount
main at showPoints do runCheck
main at showPoints branch ifError runCheck goto inspectError else goto failed
main at inspectError match checkError InputError
main at inspectError case InputError.rejected bind why String goto showWhy
main at showWhy do printWhy
main at showWhy do makeLabel
main at showWhy do makeTagged
main at showWhy goto readTagged
main at readTagged match tagged Shape
main at readTagged case Shape.box bind taggedSize Size goto failed
main at readTagged case Shape.points bind taggedPoints Numbers goto failed
main at readTagged case Shape.tagged bind inner Inner goto readInner
main at readTagged case Shape.empty bind none none goto failed
main at readInner match inner Inner
main at readInner case Inner.label bind labelText String goto showLabel
main at readInner case Inner.blank bind none none goto failed
main at showLabel do printLabel
main at showLabel do sameBox
main at showLabel do printSameBox
main at showLabel do boxVersusPoints
main at showLabel do printBoxVersusPoints
main at showLabel do makeOtherNumbers
main at showLabel do otherOne
main at showLabel do otherTwo
main at showLabel do otherThree
main at showLabel do otherFour
main at showLabel do makeOtherPoints
main at showLabel do samePoints
main at showLabel do printSamePoints
main at showLabel do makeShorter
main at showLabel do shorterOne
main at showLabel do makeShorterPoints
main at showLabel do differentPoints
main at showLabel do printDifferentPoints
main at showLabel do makeFirstLabelled
main at showLabel do makeSecondLabelled
main at showLabel do sameLabelled
main at showLabel do printSameLabelled
main at showLabel do makeOtherLabel
main at showLabel do makeOtherTagged
main at showLabel do differentTags
main at showLabel do printDifferentTags
main at showLabel return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

